---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Affiliate program" description="Earn 40% recommending the products you already use.">
  <div class="rich">
  <span class="pill">Affiliates</span>
  <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight">Liked it? Get <span class="gradient-word">paid</span> to say so.</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 text-lg muted">Every product on these paths has an affiliate link. If you recommend something you actually use, I'd rather pay you than an ad network.</p>
  <ul class="my-3 list-disc pl-6 text-white/85 space-y-1.5">
    <li class="my-1"><b>40% commission</b> on every sale through your link.</li>
    <li class="my-1"><b>Recurring</b> on Knowii memberships, for as long as the person stays.</li>
    <li class="my-1">A dedicated affiliate space in Knowii with copy, templates, and the other affiliates.</li>
    <li class="my-1">First look at launches and promotions.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed">The honest version of how this works, and how to sign up: <a href="https://www.dsebastien.net/knowii-affiliate-program/">dsebastien.net/knowii-affiliate-program</a>.</p>
  <div class="callout mt-6">One rule. Recommend what you've used. The system only works if the recommendations are true.</div>
  </div>
</Base>
